    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community by adding our game to your wishlist! Be part of this amazing journey and stay updated on all the latest news! \u2764\ufe0f<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1750305393\" width=612 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/14ab4219a033520925640ae10a010661.poster.avif?t=1750305393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/14ab4219a033520925640ae10a010661.webm?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/14ab4219a033520925640ae10a010661.mp4?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/7bbdc5fb77b3f85226789916e92ad3f9.poster.avif?t=1750305393\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/7bbdc5fb77b3f85226789916e92ad3f9.webm?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/7bbdc5fb77b3f85226789916e92ad3f9.mp4?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken World: Save Your Children is a survival game where you play as Josh, a father trying to keep his children, Edrik and Emma, alive in the midst of a zombie apocalypse. Your goal: make your way through a ruined city to the airport, where your wife awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage thirst, hunger, and happiness. Build weapons, traps, and shelters. Explore, fish, cook, and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Will you risk everything for supplies or play it safe? Teach your children to fend for themselves or protect every step? In a broken world, a father's love is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/99fee4024b62daff4ae0c5ed8c8be921.avif?t=1750305393\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/7bbdc5fb77b3f85226789916e92ad3f9.poster.avif?t=1750305393\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/7bbdc5fb77b3f85226789916e92ad3f9.webm?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/7bbdc5fb77b3f85226789916e92ad3f9.mp4?t=1750305393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken World: Save Your Children is a survival game where you play as Josh, a father trying to keep his children, Edrik and Emma, alive in the midst of a zombie apocalypse. Your goal: make your way through a ruined city to the airport, where your wife awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage thirst, hunger, and happiness. Build weapons, traps, and shelters. Explore, fish, cook, and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Will you risk everything for supplies or play it safe? Teach your children to fend for themselves or protect every step? In a broken world, a father's love is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312730/extras/99fee4024b62daff4ae0c5ed8c8be921.avif?t=1750305393\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In Broken World: Save Your Children, you play as Josh, a father fighting to keep his kids alive in a zombie apocalypse. Manage resources, build shelters, and set traps as you cross an infested city to reach the airport and reunite with your wife. Every choice matters survive at any cost.",
